      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Introducing a new performance rank would only encourage more poorly optimized avatars as it would be seen as the new ceiling to get away with, so just having the option to block avatars with this \"hidden\" performance rank is a great solution and I completely agree.\n\nIt might be smart to reword the title of this post to specify that this isn't technically asking for a new visible performance rank as I almost initially ignored this thinking you just wanted a new performance level.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-04-12T02:20:54.724Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I'm asking for an option to auto hides avatar that are designed to lag other players, pretty much an \"invasive performance\" to other players that take incredible amount of VRAM. \n\nLike a greyed out symbol for this new rank to mean it's going to give them a gray robot with an outlandish, critical or questionable etc. for the rank name\n\nThe idea came across, someone in our group with a similar base model avatar was taking half a gig of VRAM \n\nSo they will be labeled very poor like the rest of our avatars, so right now, what I understand, no way to tell unless you click on that person, so I'm hoping for a change in the future.\n\nThanks for reading.",
